1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,040
Nobody is coming to save you.

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:06,880
Not tomorrow, not next week,
and not when the stars finally align.

3
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:10,380
The harsh truth is that
you are entirely on your own.

4
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:14,320
But instead of letting that terrify you,
let it set you free.

5
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:18,040
The moment you realize no one else
is going to build the life you want,

6
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:20,840
you stop waiting
and start grinding.

7
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,440
Stop making excuses,

8
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:26,200
stop hoping for a rescue,
and become your own hero.

9
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:27,700
The heavy lifting is yours alone.

10
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,600
Now go get it!
